      "content": "i get that it was the time period, but i'm a bit confused. if he was trying to critique imperialism, why wouldn't he just describe the people more humanely? it feels like even when he's being \"critical,\" he still treats the african characters as almost less than human or just background noise. isn't it kind of contradictory to say he's critiquing the cruelty while still using such dehumanizing descriptions of the people who are actually being affected by it?",
